  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/levin-2023-agential-11> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/levin-2023-agential-11--grok--data-existence> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/levin-2023-agential-11--grok--data-adequacy> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
